  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that using scvi_n200 RNA encoder with imagenet_vit_l image encoder and transformer aggregation achieves high performance. This experiment tests whether switching to pca_n2000 RNA encoder and avgpool aggregation (while keeping imagenet_vit_l image encoder and weighted fusion) could improve accuracy. It isolates the impact of RNA encoder and aggregation methods, which are critical design choices with uncertain trade-offs."
